746→        }
747→
748→        /* ============================================
749→           RESPONSIVE COLUMN COUNT (~15% larger images)
750→           Columns still need discrete breakpoints
751→           but all spacing is now fluid
752→           ============================================ */
753→
754→        @media (max-width: 1600px) {
